  "update.checkHint": "Automatically checks GitHub for newer firmware and installs it over the WLAN configured under System.",
  "update.checkButton": "Search for updates",
  "update.confirmTitle": "Start update search?",
  "update.confirmBody": "The Pico will briefly disconnect from its own hotspot and try to join the WLAN configured under <b>System</b>, in order to check GitHub for a newer firmware.<br><br>&bull; Up to 3 connection attempts to the saved WLAN.<br>&bull; If the connection fails, the Pico automatically restores its hotspot.<br>&bull; If a newer version is found, it is downloaded and installed automatically (restart).<br>&bull; The LED blinks (2s on/2s off) while this is running.<br><br>You will briefly lose the connection to this hotspot. Please reconnect afterwards to see the result.",
